data: {"id": "8be6496386db442d-thinking-parallel_evidence-4638", "run_id": "8be6496386db442d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "---\n\n## 实采证据结论\n\n| 维度 | 结果 | 与 PendingUnschedulable 的关系 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **k8s 状态** | `phase: Pending`, `nodeName: None`, `PodScheduled condition: False` | 确认 Pod 处于 Pending 且不可调度 |\n| **Events** | `Warning FailedScheduling 99s`: `0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found` | 调度器直接报错，原因清晰 |\n| **Pod YAML** | 容器 `app` 引用 volume `input` → `PersistentVolumeClaim: unavailable-claim`；无 nodeSelector/toleration；QoS=Burstable | PVC 引用配置存在于 Pod spec |\n| **PVC 存在性** | `kube", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788863656033, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

