data: {"id": "8be6496386db442d-thinking-parallel_evidence-5330", "run_id": "8be6496386db442d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据采集小结（实体：`aiops-case-v02/workload`，UID `79a11ee3-8b7f-406f-a24f-c7e7e65347fd`）\n\n### 已确认事实（支持 PendingUnschedulable）\n1. **Pod 状态确认为 Pending**：`phase: Pending`，`nodeName: None`，`PodScheduled: status=False`。\n2. **调度器拒绝原因明确**：`kubectl describe` 和 YAML 条件中均显示 `reason=Unschedulable`，`message=\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.\"`。\n3. **容器资源请求存在异常**：`containers.app.limits.memory = 1Pi`（1 Pebibyte），尽管 `re", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788863672231, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

